#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:5
#: cce71baa78cd4ec7a0ec5905ab8941d8
msgid "Tuning Ground Steering for a Plane"
msgstr "固定翼地面转向调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:7
#: 57929711d7724642adcd169428e916c0
msgid ""
"The Plane firmware has the ability to control ground steering if you have "
"either a tail wheel or nose wheel in your aircraft. Ground steering is "
"activated in all modes except MANUAL, and when properly tuned it makes it "
"much easier to keep a plane on a straight track along the runway for takeoff"
" and landing."
msgstr ""
"Plane 固件具有控制地面转向的能力，如果您的飞机有尾轮或前轮的话。地面转向在除 Manual "
"以外的所有模式下都处于激活状态，正确调参后，在跑道起飞和降落时保持飞机直线滑行会容易得多。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:13
#: 81138a7d3d0a455d9d320b09501ec40c
msgid ""
"Ground steering may be implemented either by using a wheel coupled to a "
"RUDDER output (``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` =21), either mechanically or with an "
"second servo, or with the dedicated GroundSteering output "
"(``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` =26). If the GroundSteering output is assigned, then it"
" operates independently of the RUDDER output, otherwise, the Ground Steering"
" controller's output controls the RUDDER when below "
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>`."
msgstr ""
"地面转向可以通过以下方式实现：使用与RUDDER输出（``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` "
"=21）联动的轮子，机械联动或使用第二个舵机；或使用专用GroundSteering输出（``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` "
"=26）。如果分配了GroundSteering输出，则它独立于RUDDER输出运行；否则，地面转向控制器的输出在低于 "
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` 时控制RUDDER。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:15
#: 1d93e49cd41343cfb54c385178165490
msgid ""
"When setting up ground steering for a plane there are 4 key parameters you "
"need to get right. This guide provides a set of steps to get those "
"parameters right, so that your plane will accurately track down a runway on "
"the ground."
msgstr "为飞机设置地面转向时，需要正确设置4个关键参数。本指南提供了一组步骤来正确设置这些参数，使您的飞机能够在地面上精确地沿跑道行驶。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:21
#: ad04b4def95e4a39ac865362a5c16cdf
msgid "Controlling steering"
msgstr "控制转向"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:23
#: b870d8cb13e44918807b03fe77c3e71b
msgid ""
"To enable ground steering you need to set the "
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` parameter to something above zero."
" This is the barometric altitude above the initial altitude at which the "
"steering changes from ground steering of a wheel to rudder steering for "
"aerodynamic control. It is recommended that you set this to 5 meters to "
"allow for a bit of barometric drift."
msgstr ""
"要启用地面转向，需要将 :ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` "
"参数设置为大于零的值。这是气压高度相对于初始高度的值，超过此高度时转向从地面轮式转向切换到气动舵面转向。建议将其设置为5米，以允许一定的气压漂移余量。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:29
#: 5a479fc6c4ea42a0a6525f46a9875a73
msgid ""
"When ground steering is active it locks onto a compass heading whenever you "
"have no rudder or aileron input. So to steer the plane on the ground while "
"taxiing you should use the rudder to change direction, then take your hand "
"off both rudder and aileron to hold the current compass heading. Ground "
"steering will only work properly if you have a compass enabled."
msgstr ""
"当地面转向激活时，只要您没有方向舵或副翼输入，它就会锁定罗盘航向。因此，在地面滑行时，应使用方向舵改变方向，然后将手从方向舵和副翼上移开，以保持当前罗盘航向。地面转向仅在启用罗盘时才能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:37
#: ee8478ba9a234d0180ba06bd46aa4e44
msgid "THE KEY PARAMETERS"
msgstr "关键参数"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:39
#: 8595b5229f9a4446be0dfa62005ae48c
msgid ""
":ref:`STEER2SRV_P<STEER2SRV_P>`: This tells the code what the turning circle"
" (as a diameter in meters) is for your plane. It is critical that you get "
"this parameter right, as it tells the code what steering angle to choose to "
"achieve a desired turn rate."
msgstr ""
":ref:`STEER2SRV_P<STEER2SRV_P>`：这告诉代码您的飞机的转弯圆（以米为单位的直径）。正确设置此参数至关重要，因为它告诉代码选择什么转向角来实现所需的转弯率。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:43
#: 99df1f3b9bea45c38603db910e9f9aa3
msgid ""
":ref:`STEER2SRV_I<STEER2SRV_I>`: This is the gain from the integral of "
"steering angle. Increasing this gain causes the controller to trim out "
"steady offsets due to an out of trim vehicle.."
msgstr ":ref:`STEER2SRV_I<STEER2SRV_I>`：这是转向角积分的增益。增大此增益会使控制器消除由飞行器偏差引起的稳态偏移。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:46
#: 043c80745e3b4d9a9f9e823c8c184810
msgid ""
":ref:`STEER2SRV_D<STEER2SRV_D>`: This adjusts the damping of the steering "
"control loop. This gain helps to reduce steering jitter with vibration. It "
"should be increased in 0.01 increments as too high a value can lead to a "
"high frequency steering oscillation that could overstress the vehicle."
msgstr ""
":ref:`STEER2SRV_D<STEER2SRV_D>`：这调整转向控制回路的阻尼。此增益有助于减少震动引起的转向抖动。应以0.01为步长增加，因为值过高会导致高频转向振荡，可能使飞行器过载。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:51
#: 6b22d9521f174cccad9adc8e2e2dd53a
msgid ""
":ref:`STEER2SRV_IMAX<STEER2SRV_IMAX>`: This limits the number of degrees of "
"steering in centi-degrees over which the integrator will operate. At the "
"default setting of 1500 centi-degrees, the integrator will be limited to +- "
"15 degrees of servo travel. The maximum servo deflection is +- 45 centi-"
"degrees, so the default value represents a 1/3rd of the total control throw "
"which is adequate unless the vehicle is severely out of trim."
msgstr ""
":ref:`STEER2SRV_IMAX<STEER2SRV_IMAX>`：这限制积分器运行的转向度数（百分度）。在默认设置1500百分度下，积分器将被限制在±15度的舵机行程内。最大舵机偏转为±45百分度，因此默认值代表总控制行程的1/3，这在飞行器严重偏差的情况下是足够的。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:58
#: 401a6d735b6e4307b0255f1e4169043d
msgid ""
":ref:`STEER2SRV_MINSPD<STEER2SRV_MINSPD>`: This is the minimum assumed "
"ground speed in meters/second for steering. Having a minimum speed prevents "
"oscillations when the vehicle first starts moving. The vehicle can still "
"driver slower than this limit, but the steering calculations will be done "
"based on this minimum speed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`STEER2SRV_MINSPD<STEER2SRV_MINSPD>`：这是转向的最小假定地速（米/秒）。设置最小速度可防止飞行器开始移动时出现振荡。飞行器仍然可以以低于此限制的速度行驶，但转向计算将基于此最小速度进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:63
#: e738e6b006574e638f9fc64f90fd3f1d
msgid ""
":ref:`STEER2SRV_TCONST<STEER2SRV_TCONST>`: This controls the time constant "
"in seconds from demanded to achieved steering angle. A value of 0.75 is a "
"good default and will work with nearly all rovers. Ground steering in "
"aircraft needs a bit smaller time constant, and a value of 0.5 is "
"recommended for best ground handling in fixed wing aircraft. A value of 0.75"
" means that the controller will try to correct any deviation between the "
"desired and actual steering angle in 0.75 seconds. Advanced users may want "
"to reduce this time to obtain a faster response but there is no point "
"setting a time less than the vehicle can achieve."
msgstr ""
":ref:`STEER2SRV_TCONST<STEER2SRV_TCONST>`：这控制从需求到实现转向角的时间常数（秒）。0.75的值是一个好的默认值，几乎适用于所有地面车辆。飞机中的地面转向需要稍小的时间常数，建议固定翼飞机使用0.5以获得最佳地面操控。0.75意味着控制器将在0.75秒内纠正期望和实际转向角之间的任何偏差。高级用户可能希望减少此时间以获得更快的响应，但设置小于飞行器实际能达到的时间没有意义。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:73
#: fbf8628336a74110906127b470b8c3f0
msgid ""
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>`: Altitude at which to use the "
"ground steering controller on the rudder. If non-zero, then the STEER2SRV "
"controller will be used to control the rudder for altitudes below this limit"
" with respect to the home altitude."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>`：使用地面转向控制器控制方向舵的高度。如果非零，STEER2SRV控制器将用于控制相对于Home高度低于此限制的方向舵。"

