msgstr "这些是保守值，对大多数固定翼飞机应能提供合理的行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:95
#: c368778da7c0460095df409136b94ac9
msgid "STEP 2: SETTING THE :ref:`STEER2SRV_P<STEER2SRV_P>`"
msgstr "第2步：设置 :ref:`STEER2SRV_P<STEER2SRV_P>`"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:97
#: 9e1fb4877d8c4ac7a2a0e0a37d5c2e68
msgid ""
"To set your :ref:`STEER2SRV_P<STEER2SRV_P>` parameter you need to measure "
"the diameter of the turning circle of your plane."
msgstr "要设置 :ref:`STEER2SRV_P<STEER2SRV_P>` 参数，需要测量飞机转弯圆的直径。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:100
#: d02549c6ae934b58891302ebd80efd89
msgid ""
"With your motor off put your plane into MANUAL mode, and put the rudder hard"
" over to one side. Then slowly push your plane in a circle. Use a tape "
"measure to measure the diameter of that circle and set "
":ref:`STEER2SRV_P<STEER2SRV_P>` to that value in meters. Most planes have a "
"turning diameter of around 4 meters. If your turning diameter is a long way "
"from 4 then you may have the rates or throw on your rudder set incorrectly."
msgstr ""
"关闭电机，将飞机设置为 Manual 模式，将方向舵打到一侧到底。然后慢慢推动飞机画一个圆。用卷尺测量该圆的直径，并将 "
":ref:`STEER2SRV_P<STEER2SRV_P>` "
"设置为该值（米）。大多数飞机的转弯直径约为4米。如果转弯直径与4相差很远，则方向舵的速率或行程可能设置不正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:108
#: 05d3b29d5eb94b84922e63f520482707
msgid "Fixing Problems with weaving"
msgstr "解决S形蛇行问题"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:110
#: db0a2bee7ad545d388c95e06a1cab7a0
msgid ""
"A common issue with ground steering is that the steering 'weaves', turning "
"from side to side rather than turning smoothly. There can be several "
"possible reasons for this happening."
msgstr "地面转向的常见问题是转向「蛇行」，左右摇摆而不是平滑转弯。这可能有几个可能的原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:114
#: 27f02224662440e9b353eab8df6b72aa
msgid ""
"The first thing you need to work out is if the problem is confined to low "
"speed or also affects higher speed driving. If the problem only happens at "
"very low speed then the most likely problem is that "
":ref:`STEER2SRV_MINSPD<STEER2SRV_MINSPD>` is too low. The default is 1.0 "
"m/s, which is quite low, and if your GPS heading isn't very reliable at low "
"speed then you may need to raise that number. Try 2.0 and see if that helps "
"with low speed weaving."
msgstr ""
"首先需要确定问题是仅限于低速还是也影响高速行驶。如果问题仅在非常低的速度下发生，最可能的原因是 "
":ref:`STEER2SRV_MINSPD<STEER2SRV_MINSPD>` 太低。默认值为1.0 "
"m/s，这相当低，如果您的GPS航向在低速时不太可靠，可能需要提高该数值。尝试2.0，看看是否有助于解决低速蛇行。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:122
#: 2c9eb6f39086427ab2572fe204439f49
msgid ""
"In the steering controller there are 3 key parameters that will control "
"weaving:"
msgstr "在转向控制器中，有3个关键参数会控制蛇行："

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:125
#: 68c79acac23a44199f0f5404a0a0427c
msgid ""
"A smaller :ref:`STEER2SRV_P<STEER2SRV_P>` will reduce weaving, try reducing "
"it by 0.1 at a time"
msgstr "较小的 :ref:`STEER2SRV_P<STEER2SRV_P>` 将减少蛇行，尝试每次减少0.1"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:127
#: cfc1907964ab435e9c5a1f3cbfded5fa
msgid ""
"A larger :ref:`STEER2SRV_D<STEER2SRV_D>` will \"damp\" the weaving, but if "
"you make it too large then you will get high speed oscillation. For example "
"you may find that a value of 0.1 reduces the damping, but a value of 0.2 "
"could cause a high speed oscillation in the steering servo. If you get fast "
"oscillation then reduce the :ref:`STEER2SRV_D<STEER2SRV_D>` value by 50%."
msgstr ""
"较大的 :ref:`STEER2SRV_D<STEER2SRV_D>` "
"将「阻尼」蛇行，但如果过大会导致高速振荡。例如，您可能发现0.1的值减少了阻尼，但0.2的值可能导致转向舵机高速振荡。如果出现快速振荡，则将 "
":ref:`STEER2SRV_D<STEER2SRV_D>` 值减小50%。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:132
#: 6be858223d49412389f9a306f5a654fc
msgid ""
"A larger :ref:`STEER2SRV_TCONST<STEER2SRV_TCONST>` will slow down the "
"steering controller, which will reduce weaving. Try raising it in steps of "
"0.1."
msgstr ""
"较大的 :ref:`STEER2SRV_TCONST<STEER2SRV_TCONST>` 将减慢转向控制器，从而减少蛇行。尝试以0.1为步长增加。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:135
#: 2a9eed7d90e942a9a9c3b27038b9b591
msgid ""
"With the current controller system you do need to experiment a bit with "
"these values to get the behaviour you want."
msgstr "使用当前的控制器系统，确实需要对这些值进行一些实验，以获得所需的行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:139
#: 33f8b8f666ea4af9873ff2f5888c8ce4
msgid "Tuning for auto-takeoff"
msgstr "自动起飞调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:141
#: 63c9379f46d8445993ee31237c03a6c3
msgid ""
"To tune the ground steering for auto-takeoff it is generally best to do the "
"tuning in FBWA mode, and only change to auto-takeoff once you can takeoff in"
" FBWA mode without overriding the steering at all (ie. takeoff without using"
" the rudder stick)."
msgstr ""
"要为自动起飞调参地面转向，通常最好先在FBWA模式下进行调参，只有在FBWA模式下能够起飞而完全不需要覆盖转向（即起飞时不使用方向舵摇杆）之后，再切换到自动起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:146
#: e9cd16ebc1ce407cb348fddf0f9805d9
msgid ""
"It can also be very helpful to use the :ref:`FBWA Takeoff Elevator <takeoff-"
"fbwa>` option to setup the same automated elevator behaviour as is used in "
"auto-takeoff when in FBWA mode. That helps keep tail wheels on the ground in"
" taildragger aircraft (and can also be used to keep nose wheels on the "
"ground in tricycle aircraft)."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`FBWA起飞升降舵 <takeoff-fbwa>` "
"选项来设置与FBWA模式下自动起飞相同的自动升降舵行为也非常有帮助。这有助于在尾撑飞机中将尾轮保持在地面（也可用于在三轮飞机中将前轮保持在地面）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:153
#: aa9d624308bb48f8a9afe080b148a467
msgid "Limiting the steering to prevent a roll on a wing"
msgstr "限制转向以防止机翼侧翻"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:155
#: 4095f1ae12754e2c9476790a4a18cf9d
msgid ""
"On a large fast planes, especially with large wingspan, there is a chance on"
" rolling on the wing if the steering is too aggressive. To coupe with this "
"problem steering limiting can be setup that will derate steering angles with"
" increasing speed. When the speed is lower than the set derating speed, no "
"limit occurs and the angle for steering is passed through without changes. "
"When the speed increase, the steering angle starts to decrease at a setup "
"rate until the minimum steering angle is reached."
msgstr ""
"对于大型高速飞机，尤其是翼展较大的飞机，如果转向过于激进，有机翼侧翻的风险。为了解决这个问题，可以设置转向限制，随着速度增加降低转向角。当速度低于设定的降额速度时，不发生限制，转向角直接通过不变化。当速度增加时，转向角开始以设定速率减小，直到达到最小转向角。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:164
#: aa57b1d9a4bb44c1a512ea9e3abd72ac
msgid ""
":ref:`STEER2SRV_DRTSPD<STEER2SRV_DRTSPD>`: After this speed the steering "
"angle gets reduced. The units are m/s"
msgstr ":ref:`STEER2SRV_DRTSPD<STEER2SRV_DRTSPD>`：超过此速度后转向角开始减小。单位为m/s"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane.rst:165
#: edf60d5994124b07ad0cd22a331b8cad
msgid ""
":ref:`STEER2SRV_DRTFCT<STEER2SRV_DRTFCT>`: Amount of degrees to reduce per "
"each additional m/s increase in speed. The units are in °/m/s"
